{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Correction to the previous comment: no follow-up is needed. The stricter fuzz's failing cases (STATUS/CREATE/EDIT with data absent or null, or status as a list) are events that cannot make the reducer's status the string 'closed' (process_create sets state['status'] = data.get('status', ...), and a list or missing value is not 'closed'), so treating such a ticket as never closed is correct. The fuzz's expectation was over-strict, not the gate."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1795344688944085001,"uuid":"1910ea4d-c211-448e-a87f-7d2c9b595299"}